AltoBaseMarket::TagLiquidablePosition()
├── when market is paused
│   └── it should revert
├── when priority liquidation is disabled
│   └── it should revert
├── given user position is solvent
│   └── it should revert with AltoPriorityLiquidationEngineLiquidatingSolventPosition
└── given user position is not solvent
    ├── when liquidator is a priority liquidator
    │   └── it should revert with AltoPriorityLiquidationEngineLiquidationUnauthorized
    ├── when user has already been tagged
    │   ├── when liquidationWindowTag has not expired
    │   │   └── it should revert with AltoPriorityLiquidationEngineLiquidationAlreadyTagged
    │   └── when liquidationWindowTag has expired
    │       ├── it should emit AccrueInterest event
    │       ├── it should update liquidablePositions
    │       └── it should emit PositionTagged event  
    └── when user has not been tagged
│       ├── it should emit AccrueInterest event
│       ├── it should update liquidablePositions
│       └── it should emit PositionTagged event  